0Z","notes":"Reviewed issue with Jordan, sounds like there's 5 overall devices, so as long as the vendor uses a browser to access we can do a port forward with port translation and use a single public IP. Also need to get their office public IP to lock down the port forward.","chargeToId":714038,"actualHours":0.2,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #714038","timesheetId":28560},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T15:48:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T15:30:00.000Z","notes":"Reviewed replacement P2P APs that Mat and Jordan found, discussed deployment plans.","chargeToId":718200,"actualHours":0.3,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #718200","timesheetId":28560},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T16:06:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T15:48:00.000Z","notes":"Reviewed issues and tickets.","chargeToId":51,"actualHours":0.3,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"22.5 - Board/Ticket Planning","timesheetId":28560},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T16:42:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T16:06:00.000Z","notes":"Worked with Seth to make sure FFC was in CIPP and security standards were applying correctly.","chargeToId":717591,"actualHours":0.6,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #717591","timesheetId":28560},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T17:06:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T16:42:00.000Z","notes":"Found that the outbound emails were not going through barracuda because they were from the thyroidutah.com domain, which had already been moved to a new tenant for ThyroidUtah.  Enabled the connector to send straight to the internet, disabled the barracuda connector, and restarted the transport service.  Messages went out, then rolled back changes.","chargeToId":718186,"actualHours":0.4,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #718186","timesheetId":28560}],"timesheetId":28560}]
