cted. Computer was disconnected from the domain for so long that the Equinox credentials didn't work initially, but after GPUpdate all is good. Checked to see if the user is using their own account or the Tech user. The Lenovo laptops should all be using the Tech user since they go back and forth between the site and client site. ","chargeToId":718268,"actualHours":0.5,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #718268","timesheetId":28569},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T13:00:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T12:48:00.000Z","notes":"Replied to Brea's email and coordinated with TA to set exception for the travel outside the country. Scheduled to put into the Geofence exempt group on Thursday 7/2.","chargeToId":718187,"actualHours":0.2,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #718187","timesheetId":28569},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T13:30:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T13:00:00.000Z","notes":"Reviewed dns/reputation items with SWAT. Updated Clayton and Erik on the next steps. ","chargeToId":718164,"actualHours":0.5,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #718164","timesheetId":28569},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T14:00:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T13:30:00.000Z","notes":"Lunch","chargeToId":72,"actualHours":0,"hoursDeduct":0.5,"chargecode":"97 - Off Clock (deduct field)","timesheetId":28569},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T14:30:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T14:00:00.000Z","notes":"Reviewed all findings with Dexter, Dallin, Seth, and Steve. Discussed things that went well and items to improve. The issue is resolved and they are good. ","chargeToId":718171,"actualHours":0.5,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #718171","timesheetId":28569},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T15:00:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T14:30:00.000Z","notes":"Received the call from Dr. O requesting the fax info that Thyroid had from PEAK. Worked with Camden to locate the files and get uploaded into SharePoint. ","chargeToId":718236,"actualHours":0.5,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #718236","timesheetId":28569},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-3