heetId":28569},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T15:30:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T15:00:00.000Z","notes":"Call with new MSP confirmed transfer of Keeper to an MSP account. Updated TA for the migration. Updated Alex that the migration is being done and that they have 14 days to finish from their end. ","chargeToId":713180,"actualHours":0.5,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #713180","timesheetId":28569},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T16:30:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T15:30:00.000Z","notes":"Reviewed client offboarding process with Seth. Discussed items that went well and what could improve. ","chargeToId":37,"actualHours":1,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"25 - Individual Training","timesheetId":28569},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T16:48:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T16:30:00.000Z","notes":"Reached out to 1Wire for the static IP info. There isn't any setup on the account. Received pricing and called Mark to review. He's good to move forward with the needed IPs. ","chargeToId":718266,"actualHours":0.3,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #718266","timesheetId":28569},{"timeEnd":"2026-06-30T17:00:00.000Z","timeStart":"2026-06-30T16:48:00.000Z","notes":"Emailed Troy to get more info on the email to be setup. ","chargeToId":717674,"actualHours":0.2,"hoursDeduct":0,"chargecode":"Ticket #717674","timesheetId":28569}],"timesheetId":28569}]
